 Z←TS Printed Sky;H;MN;AP
⍝ Footer with generation timestamp TS (as ⎕TS)
⍝ As in the book, the day name is the observation's (#22)
 H←12|TS[4]
 :If H=0 ⋄ H←12 ⋄ :EndIf
 AP←(1+TS[4]<12)⊃'PM' 'AM'
 MN←⍕⌊TS[5]
 :If 1=≢MN ⋄ MN←'0',MN ⋄ :EndIf
 Z←'' ('GENERATED ',(DAYNAME Sky.StatedDayNo),' ',(⍕TS[1]),'/',(⍕TS[2]),'/',(⍕TS[3]),' AT ',(⍕⌊H),':',MN,' ',AP)
